---
title: "多重插补-结合tidymodels"
---

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(tidyverse)
library(mice)
library(gt)
library(tidymodels)
tidymodels_prefer()
```
:::




## 模拟带缺失值的数据，包括两个自变量和一个因变量，并添加分组变量




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
data <- data.frame(
  x1 = rnorm(100),
  x2 = rnorm(100),
  y = rnorm(100),
  group = as_factor(sample(1:2, 100, replace = TRUE))
)

data$x1[sample(1:100, 20)] <- NA
data$x2[sample(1:100, 15)] <- NA

summary(data)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
